<title>USA: BWAY Corp sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>BWAY Corp sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BWAY Corp said its board has declared a three-for-two stock split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The distribution of additional shares will be made September 22 to shareholders of record September 2.</p>
<p>BWAY added that it remains focused on strategic growth and will continue to pursue strategic opportunities.</p>
